{"version":"6.9","hitCount":1,"request":{"queryString":"EXT_ID:15459799 AND SRC:MED","internalQuery":"EXT_ID:15459799 AND SRC:MED","resultType":"CORE","cursorMark":"*","pageSize":25,"sort":"","synonym":false},"resultList":{"result":[{"id":"15459799","source":"MED","pmid":"15459799","doi":"10.1007/s00253-004-1743-y","title":"Batch and fed-batch production of coenzyme Q10 in recombinant Escherichia coli containing the decaprenyl diphosphate synthase gene from Gluconobacter suboxydans.","authorString":"Park YC, Kim SJ, Choi JH, Lee WH, Park KM, Kawamukai M, Ryu YW, Seo JH.","authorList":{"author":[{"fullName":"Park YC","lastName":"Park","firstName":"Yong-Cheol","initials":"YC","authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"School of Agricultural Biotechnology, Center for Agricultural Biomaterials, Seoul National University, Seoul, 151-742, South Korea. jhseo94@snu.ac.kr"}]}},{"fullName":"Kim SJ","lastName":"Kim","firstName":"Soo-Jung","initials":"SJ"},{"fullName":"Choi JH","lastName":"Choi","firstName":"Jin-Ho","initials":"JH"},{"fullName":"Lee WH","lastName":"Lee","firstName":"Won-Heong","initials":"WH"},{"fullName":"Park KM","lastName":"Park","firstName":"Kyung-Moon","initials":"KM"},{"fullName":"Kawamukai M","lastName":"Kawamukai","firstName":"Mokoto","initials":"M","authorId":{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0003-2929-8798"}},{"fullName":"Ryu YW","lastName":"Ryu","firstName":"Yeon-Woo","initials":"YW"},{"fullName":"Seo JH","lastName":"Seo","firstName":"Jin-Ho","initials":"JH"}]},"authorIdList":{"authorId":[{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0003-2929-8798"}]},"journalInfo":{"issue":"2","volume":"67","journalIssueId":1227905,"dateOfPublication":"2005 Apr","monthOfPublication":4,"yearOfPublication":2005,"journal":{"medlineAbbreviation":"Appl Microbiol Biotechnol","title":"Applied microbiology and biotechnology","essn":"1432-0614","issn":"0175-7598","nlmid":"8406612","isoabbreviation":"Appl Microbiol Biotechnol"},"printPublicationDate":"2005-04-01"},"pubYear":"2005","pageInfo":"192-196","abstractText":"Coenzyme Q(10) (CoQ(10)) is a quinine consisting of ten units of the isoprenoid side-chain. Because it limits the oxidative attack of free radicals to DNA and lipids, CoQ(10) has been used as an antioxidant for foods, cosmetics and pharmaceuticals. Decaprenyl diphosphate synthase (DPS) is the key enzyme for synthesis of the decaprenyl tail in CoQ(10) with isopentenyl diphosphate. The ddsA gene coding for DPS from Gluconobacter suboxydans was expressed under the control of an Escherichia coli constitutive promoter. Analysis of the cell extract in recombinant E. coli BL21/pACDdsA by high performance liquid chromatography and mass spectrometry showed that CoQ(10) rather than endogenous CoQ(8) was biologically synthesized as the major coenzyme Q. Expression of the ddsA gene with low copy number led to the accumulation of CoQ(10) to 0.97 mg l(-1) in batch fermentation. A high cell density (103 g l(-1)) in fed-batch fermentation of E. coli BL21/pACDdsA increased the CoQ(10) concentration to 25.5 mg l (-1) and its productivity to 0.67 mg l(-1) h(-1), which were 26.0 and 6.9 times higher than the corresponding values for batch fermentation.","affiliation":"School of Agricultural Biotechnology, Center for Agricultural Biomaterials, Seoul National University, Seoul, 151-742, South Korea. jhseo94@snu.ac.kr","publicationStatus":"ppublish","language":"eng","pubModel":"Print-Electronic","pubTypeList":{"pubType":["Research Support, Non-U.S. Gov't","Journal Article"]},"meshHeadingList":{"meshHeading":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Gluconobacter","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","abbreviation":"EN","qualifierName":"enzymology"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Escherichia coli","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","abbreviation":"GE","qualifierName":"genetics"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Ubiquinone","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","abbreviation":"AA","qualifierName":"analogs & derivatives"},{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","abbreviation":"BI","qualifierName":"biosynthesis"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Coenzymes"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Alkyl and Aryl Transferases","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","abbreviation":"GE","qualifierName":"genetics"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Recombinant Proteins","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","abbreviation":"BI","qualifierName":"biosynthesis"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","descriptorName":"Fermentation"}]},"chemicalList":{"chemical":[{"name":"decaprenyl pyrophosphate synthetase","registryNumber":"EC 2.5.1.-"},{"name":"Coenzymes","registryNumber":"0"},{"name":"Ubiquinone","registryNumber":"1339-63-5"},{"name":"Recombinant Proteins","registryNumber":"0"},{"name":"Alkyl and Aryl Transferases","registryNumber":"EC 2.5.-"},{"name":"coenzyme Q10","registryNumber":"EJ27X76M46"}]},"subsetList":{"subset":[{"code":"IM","name":"Index Medicus"}]},"fullTextUrlList":{"fullTextUrl":[{"availability":"Subscription required","availabilityCode":"S","documentStyle":"doi","site":"DOI","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00253-004-1743-y"}]},"isOpenAccess":"N","inEPMC":"N","inPMC":"N","citedByCount":45,"hasReferences":"Y","hasTextMinedTerms":"Y","hasDbCrossReferences":"N","hasPDF":"N","hasBook":"N","hasSuppl":"N","hasLabsLinks":"N","hasData":"N","authMan":"N","epmcAuthMan":"N","nihAuthMan":"N","hasTMAccessionNumbers":"N","dateOfCompletion":"2005-06-09","dateOfCreation":"2004-10-02","dateOfRevision":"2014-11-20","electronicPublicationDate":"2004-10-01","firstPublicationDate":"2004-10-01","firstIndexDate":"2008-01-29","hasEvaluations":"N"}]}}